    "description": "Pens and stables, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Fenced paddock with a gateway (open gap; fence gates are decoration) before an open-sided log stable with two stalls and a feed trough; L2 adds the hay loft, tack corner and water trough, L3 a farrier corner, weathervane, banners and flower boxes. Wants level ground.",
